<title>JAPAN: Nankai Tatsumura - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nankai Tatsumura - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 38.56		vs	   26.27</p>
<p> Operating	  184 million	 vs	  842 million</p>
